<title>USA: Aon sees Minet adding to earnings in 1998.</title>
<headline>Aon sees Minet adding to earnings in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aon Corp chief executive Patrick Ryan told analysts in a conference call on Thursday that he expects the Minet Group to contribute about $0.12 a share to earnings in 1998.</p>
<p>Aon agreed in April to acquire London-based Minet from St. Paul Cos Inc. Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Ryan said he expects most of the contribution to earnings to come in the second half of 1998.</p>
<p>&quot;We would like you to look at it as being basically second-half driven, '98,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>((Patricia Vowinkel 212-859-1716))</p>
